.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
# Ignore runs/ contents EXCEPT e2e-baselines (v4 Rule 26 metric-loop artifacts)
# AND the small set of "proof receipts" PROJECT_STATE references as evidence
# of the trust-spine claims (Day 8.2 reviewer P2: a fresh clone must include
# the audit artifacts that back the status table; otherwise the docs cite
# evidence the cloner can't see).
# Note: must use runs/* not runs/ so the negation pattern can re-include
# subdirectories — git won't recurse into a wholly-ignored dir.
runs/*
!runs/e2e-baselines/
runs/e2e-baselines/*.tmp
# Proof receipts referenced in PROJECT_STATE — tracked as audit evidence.
# Pre-Day-9.1 receipts (baseline run-rates that motivated the AAA push):
!runs/metformin-001-2026-04-28T17-42-13Z-29dd/
!runs/rapamycin-002-2026-04-28T17-43-13Z-89e6/
!runs/rapamycin-002-2026-04-28T17-37-47Z-ecd5/
!runs/everolimus-003-2026-04-28T17-44-06Z-15a3/
!runs/everolimus-003-2026-04-28T17-22-15Z-288e/
# Post-Day-9.1 receipts (numeric_in_text trace closes auditor's main
# rejection; rapamycin run-rate jumped from 1/4 to 4/5 accept):
!runs/metformin-001-2026-04-28T18-26-46Z-c1e0/
!runs/rapamycin-002-2026-04-28T18-23-28Z-2f4e/
!runs/everolimus-003-2026-04-28T18-28-43Z-0088/
# Day 9.2 best-of-5 canonical receipts (each carries best_of_n_manifest.json
# listing all 5 attempts; --best-of 5 produces deterministic accept_* on
# all three drugs):
!runs/metformin-001-2026-04-28T18-38-21Z-fdcc/
!runs/rapamycin-002-2026-04-28T18-41-35Z-dc46/
!runs/everolimus-003-2026-04-28T18-47-44Z-734c/
# Day 9.3 live-retrieval canonical-anchoring receipt — first --live run
# where ALL 4 metformin canonical trials (MASTERS / MET-PREVENT / TAME /
# MILES) surface in the corpus + accept_clean on a single attempt:
!runs/metformin-001-2026-04-28T19-01-44Z-d1f4/
# Day 10.6 — first synthesis paper: 12 metformin claim receipts → one
# integrated paper_synthesis.md, audit score 10/10 across 7 quality
# checks (all 3 load-bearing Q1/Q3/Q5 pass). Caveat: false-positive,
# all 12 receipts anchored on MASTERS NCT02308228 (duplicate aggregation,
# not real cross-source — closed by Day 10.7+10.8a gate fixes).
!runs/synthesis-metformin-010-2026-04-29T05-52-53Z-caa9/
# Day 10.8c — first real cross-source proof:
#   producer: 13 cluster receipts from a single metformin --multi-receipt run
!runs/metformin-multi-001-2026-04-29T09-23-01Z-44b9/
#   consumer: synthesis across 13 unique canonical trials, audit 8.3/10
#   (Q3 load-bearing fail on direct/indirect transition — system correctly
#   ship-blocks). The architecture is verified end-to-end; remaining
#   gap is writer-side, not gate-side.
!runs/synthesis-metformin-010-2026-04-29T09-32-28Z-0d63/
tests_legacy/golden/fixture_runs/
tests_legacy/golden/fixture_runs_debug/
*.egg-info/
.env*
!.env.example

scripts/karpathy-loop/snapshots/
scripts/karpathy-loop/diffs/

